# Ordered CoE setup for velocity PDO map (kernel elc_setup batch).
# Applied in PREOP by iod (ECSETUPRECIPE) before cycle activate / OP.
#
# Format: sequence position type index subindex value
# POS expanded per target bus position.
#
# Profile accel/decel (0x6083/0x6084):
#   Write non-zero values HERE in PREOP if the slave will enter PP/PV and these
#   objects are RxPDO-mapped. First OP frames may zero-gate cyclic outputs until
#   plant ANALOGOUTPUT defaults are published — SDO pre-load avoids that window.
#   Per-group values: extra ECSETUPRECIPE (e.g. profile_accel_800k.recipe.in).
#
# Mode of operation (0x6060):
#   Set only after accel objects are valid. If the drive rejects mode in PREOP
#   (SDO abort), leave mode to plant L_SDO / enable path after process image is live.
1  POS u8  0x1c12 0 0
2  POS u8  0x1c13 0 0
3  POS u8  0x1600 0 0
4  POS u8  0x1a00 0 0
5  POS u32 0x1600 1 0x60400010
6  POS u32 0x1600 2 0x60ff0020
7  POS u32 0x1600 3 0x60830020
8  POS u32 0x1600 4 0x60840020
9  POS u32 0x1600 5 0x60e00010
10 POS u32 0x1600 6 0x60e10010
11 POS u32 0x1a00 1 0x60410010
12 POS u32 0x1a00 2 0x606c0020
13 POS u32 0x1a00 3 0x60770010
14 POS u32 0x1a00 4 0x603f0010
15 POS u8  0x1600 0 6
16 POS u8  0x1a00 0 4
17 POS u16 0x1c12 1 0x1600
18 POS u16 0x1c13 1 0x1a00
19 POS u8  0x1c12 0 1
20 POS u8  0x1c13 0 1
21 POS u32 0x6083 0 200000
22 POS u32 0x6084 0 200000
23 POS u8  0x6060 0 3
